=top&w=200&h=200&s=6337cfca89d7a8d891029cddd412bc84 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, 社ゴsensei!\nI’m a big fan of your artwork and I really want to send you a commission for those cute super deformed (SD).\nIn the attached link, two sets of characters can be found. You can freely choose the characters in one link out of the two to finish the work depending on your own taste. No other requirement is asked so that the only need for you is to follow what you want to draw!\nI'm sincerely looking forward to you taking my commission!\nWarm Regards.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZXuFhQrZEeZqFBG9h1xWc6WNcY195-U8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k811ne/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a9eadb6/uploads/origins/1713c1f2-1158-4069-ad22-138be2e0e1c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b367e85bccd8e9f201677ff3e7e5a3a1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a9eadb6/uploads/origins/1713c1f2-1158-4069-ad22-138be2e0e1c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b367e85bccd8e9f201677ff3e7e5a3a1, https://si.imgix.net/2a9eadb6/uploads/origins/1713c1f2-1158-4069-ad22-138be2e0e1c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a560da90f031cb152e07eed5afc10c4d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a9eadb6/uploads/origins/1713c1f2-1158-4069-ad22-138be2e0e1c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c289a71fde3a324aa5a4bee76c09e666 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、skebで偶然に社ゴ様の作品を見て気に入りました\n可愛い画風に惹かれでクエリーします\n応援している個人勢vtuberのイラストを描いて欲しい\n\nキャラクター名前は安久毬亜　アクマリア\nアビスから来たヤギの小悪魔\n人間界に閉じ込められた後にメイド喫茶のアルバイトで生きる\n性格は人馴れて活発な、時々いたずらする子\n\nデザイン・二次創作の許可などはリンクにご参照ください\nhttps://imgur.com/a/iBFgXTZ\n3種類の服のどれを描くかは自由に決めてください\n\nどうか、よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k811ne/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6a455b67/uploads/origins/52e6a602-81f9-4b67-a691